Subject: [PATCH v2] kdump, vmcoreinfo: report actual value of phys_base
From: HATAYAMA Daisuke <d.hatayama@jp.fujitsu.com>
X-Mailer: Mew version 6.6 on Emacs 23.1 / Mule 6.0 (HANACHIRUSATO)
